     m_sContent "The Soviets have garrisoned this position and set up a command post. Intel suggests a high ranking officer is attendance, and has a map on his person with detailed planned troop movements. We are to take this position, and hold it, drawing the Soviets from Lamentin to allow our comrades to attack the armoury. "\
